## 1. Container Management

### List Running Containers

```bash
docker ps
docker ps -a  # Include stopped containers
```

### Start/Stop Containers

```bash
# Start all services
docker-compose up -d

# Stop all services
docker-compose down

# Restart specific container
docker restart <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name>
docker restart thehive
docker restart cortex
```

### Access Container Shell

```bash
# Wazuh Manager
docker exec -it <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> bash

# TheHive
docker exec -it thehive bash

# Cortex
docker exec -it cortex bash
```

### View Container Logs

```bash
# Real-time logs
docker logs -f <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name>
docker logs -f thehive
docker logs -f cortex

# Last 50 lines
docker logs --tail 50 <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name>
```

### Check Container Networks

```bash
# List networks
docker network ls

# Inspect specific network
docker network inspect Hive

# Check container's network
docker inspect <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> | grep NetworkMode
```

