## 2. Network Troubleshooting

### VM Network Issues

#### Check Interface Status

```bash
# View all interfaces
ip addr show
ifconfig

# Specific interface
ip addr show <your_interface>
```

#### Bring Interface Up

```bash
# Bring up interface
sudo ip link set <your_interface> up

# Request DHCP
sudo dhclient -v <your_interface>

# Restart NetworkManager
sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager
```

#### Test Connectivity

```bash
# Test internet
ping -c 3 8.8.8.8
ping -c 3 google.com

# Test from container
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> ping -c 3 8.8.8.8

# Test specific port
telnet <STACK_IP> 9000
nc -zv <STACK_IP> 9000
```

#### VMware Network Fix

```bash
# Install VMware Tools
sudo apt update
sudo apt install open-vm-tools open-vm-tools-desktop -y
sudo reboot
```

