## 3. Wazuh Agent Management

### List Agents

```bash
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> /var/ossec/bin/agent_control -l
```

### Check Agent Status

```bash
# Detailed agent info
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> /var/ossec/bin/agent_control -i 001

# Check connected agents
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> /var/ossec/bin/agent_control -lc
```

### View Wazuh Logs

```bash
# Manager logs
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> tail -f /var/ossec/logs/ossec.log

# Alert logs (JSON)
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> tail -f /var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.json

# Integration logs
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> tail -f /var/ossec/logs/integrations.log

# View last 100 alerts
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> tail -100 /var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.json
```

### Restart Wazuh Services

```bash
# Restart Wazuh manager
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> /var/ossec/bin/wazuh-control restart

# Check status
docker exec <your_Wazuh-manager_container_name> /var/ossec/bin/wazuh-control status
```

### 4. Windows Agent Commands

#### Check Agent Status (Windows PowerShell)

```powershell
# Check service status
Get-Service WazuhSvc

# Start/Stop service
NET START WazuhSvc
NET STOP WazuhSvc

# View agent logs
Get-Content "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.log" -Tail 50
```

#### Agent Configuration

```powershell
# View config
Get-Content "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf"

# Edit config (replace manager IP)
(Get-Content "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf") -replace '0.0.0.0', '<STACK_IP>' | Set-Content "C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf"
```

