## 8. Configuration Files

### Key Configuration Locations

#### Wazuh Manager

```
/var/ossec/etc/ossec.conf                    # Main configuration
/var/ossec/etc/shared/default/agent.conf     # Agent configuration
/var/ossec/integrations/custom-w2thive.py    # Integration script
/var/ossec/logs/ossec.log                    # Manager logs
/var/ossec/logs/alerts/alerts.json           # Alert logs
/var/ossec/logs/integrations.log             # Integration logs
```

#### Windows Agent

```
C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.conf         # Configuration
C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\ossec.log          # Agent logs
C:\Program Files (x86)\ossec-agent\client.keys        # Agent keys
```

#### TheHive

```
./thehive/application.conf                    # TheHive config
./thehive/data/                               # Data directory
```

#### Cortex

```
./cortex/application.conf                     # Cortex config
./cortex/log/                                 # Log directory
```

### Sample Integration Block (ossec.conf)

```xml
<integration>
  <name>custom-w2thive</name>
  <hook_url>http://<STACK_IP>:9000</hook_url>
  <api_key>YOUR_API_KEY_HERE</api_key>
  <alert_format>json</alert_format>
  <level>7</level>  <!-- Only alerts level 7 and above -->
</integration>
```

### Sample Windows Agent Config (ossec.conf)

```xml
<client>
  <server>
    <address><STACK_IP></address>
    <port>1514</port>
    <protocol>tcp</protocol>
  </server>
  <crypto_method>aes</crypto_method>
</client>
```

